 demonios del pasado que les han estado atormentando hasta ahora...<br><br>\u00bfEst\u00e1s listo para unirte a esta aventura llena de camarader\u00eda, acci\u00f3n y humor? \u00a1Entonces \u00fanete a Rodolfo Mascarpone &amp; Ram\u00f3n Cazanuecos y prep\u00e1rate para disfrutar una gran diversi\u00f3n en compa\u00f1ia!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542580/extras/f8f157ba4daab8e09d493c80f37874c1.poster.avif?t=1713901064\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542580/extras/f8f157ba4daab8e09d493c80f37874c1.webm?t=1713901064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2542580/extras/f8f157ba4daab8e09d493c80f37874c1.mp4?t=1713901064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
